      "widgets_values": [
        "Reconstruct only the complete open green hardcover shell of this exact book, removing every paper page and its thickness. Retain the broad open-book pose, slanted outer sides, four warm gold corner protectors, narrow green rails, lower curved spine and reference camera. Expose coherent nearly smooth painted green binding across both halves with fine restrained texture matching the original visible cover. No paper, page ornaments, logo, text, buttons, bookmarks, portrait, counters, scene or table. Complete isolated empty open binding centered on uniform neutral gray. No new white glossy spots, photographic leather, coarse grain, filigree or external cast shadow."
